Local modifications: exports map repointed from the upstream intx-src condition to direct TypeScript source resolution (types/default -> ./src/...); dist references removed. Upstream test files are not vendored (they import the unvendored @intx/inference-testing and @intx/test-harness test packages). CL-6396: sidecar-events.ts carries an optional childRunId on the agent.event frame so the hub can close the matching occurrence row. corbitsdev/workbench#709: session-service.ts fans every top-level prepared-deploy step out through stageWorkflowStep (pure preparedStepStageArgs maps one step address via resolveStepAddress and agent id via deriveStepAgentId); workflow-allocation-service.ts rehydrates both from the frozen launch spec (preparedDeployContent fails closed without a string systemPrompt). Upstream now threads deployContent/toolPackagePins natively; the address/id mapping and the fail-closed narrowing stay local. Retired at this pin: the CL-7505 servingRefresh hook in credential-push.ts and the CL-7508 OAuth loopback login flow in sidecar-handler.ts (both replaced by @corbits/oauth-core/hub).
